        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.28.2",
      "label": "1.28.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "गृहीतास्त्रोऽस्मि भगवन् दुराधर्षः सुरैरपि |\nअस्त्राणां त्वहमिच्छामि संहारं मुनिपुंगव",
      "iast": "gṛhīta astro asmi bhagavan durādharṣaḥ suraiḥ api |\nastrāṇām tu aham icchāmi saṃhāram munipuṅgava",
      "translation": "\"Oh, godly sage, I have taken the missiles and became unassailable even for gods, but oh, eminent sage, I wish to know the annulment of missiles too.\" So said Rama to the sage.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
