          "iast": "astrāṇām samhāram icchāmi",
          "devanagari": "अस्त्राणां सम्हारं इच्छामि",
          "meaning": "for the missiles, annulment, I wish [to know.]",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 7
        }
      ]
