    {
      "id": "1.28.14",
      "label": "1.28.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "गम्यतामिति तानाह यथेष्टं रघुनन्दनः |\nमानसाः कार्यकालेषु साहाय्यं मे करिष्यथ",
      "iast": "gaṃyatām iti tān āha yathā iṣṭam raghunandanaḥ |\nmānasāḥ kārya kāleṣu sāhāyyam me kariṣyatha",
      "translation": "\"While remaining in my memory you assist me as and when needed, and till then you may go away as you wish,\" thus that legatee of Raghu-s said to those deities of annulment missiles.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "maanasaaH",
          "iast": "mānasāḥ",
          "devanagari": "मानसाः",
