    {
      "id": "1.28.16",
      "label": "1.28.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "स च तान् राघवो ज्ञात्वा विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम् |\nगच्छन्नेवाथ मधुरं श्लक्ष्णं वचनमब्रवीत्",
      "iast": "sa ca tān rāghavo jñātvā viśvāmitram mahāmunim |\ngacchan eva atha madhuram ślakṣṇam vacanam abravīt",
      "translation": "After learning the nullifying missiles and then while proceeding on the walkway Raghava asked the great sage Vishvamitra with sweet and soft words.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "saH raaghavaH ca",
          "iast": "saḥ rāghavaḥ ca",
