    {
      "id": "1.28.17",
      "label": "1.28.17, 18",
      "numbers": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "किं न्वेतन्मेघसंकाशं पर्वतस्याविदूरतः |\nवृक्षखण्डमिवाभाति परं कौतूहलं हि मे\nदर्शनीयं मृगाकीर्णं मनोहरमतीव च |\nनानाप्रकारैः शकुनैर्वल्गुभाषैरलंकृतम्",
      "iast": "kim etan megha saṅkāśam parvatasya avidūrataḥ |\nvṛkṣa khaṇḍam itaḥ bhāti param kautūhalam hi me\ndarśanīyam mṛgāakīrṇam manoharam atīva ca |\nnānā prakāraiḥ śakunaiḥ val.hgubhāṣaiḥ alaṅkṛtam",
      "translation": "\"What is this cloudlike picturesque thicket shining forth not very far away on this side of mountain, with animals spreading over it, and embellished with numerous kinds of birds that have pleasant callings it is highly soul-delighting, thus, my inquisitiveness is growing very much to know it, what is this, really!",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "itaH parvatasya",
          "iast": "itaḥ parvatasya",
          "devanagari": "इतः पर्वतस्य",
          "meaning": "on this side, of mountain",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
